# =========================================================================
# VVDN -- CHI HA CANH 35L, 60 PHUT, HUONG 35, NANG LUC TOI DA
# Khong co tau cat canh; tau den van thoat ly G4/G6 va cat qua 35R ve ben
# =========================================================================
# Sinh boi _gen_vvdn_chi_cat_chi_ha.py, seed 20261109. Quy tac: vvdn_chi_cat_chi_ha_rules.json + vvdn_xenke_rules.json.
# Quy mo: 29 chuyen den (20 MEDIUM + 9 HEAVY); HEAVY rai deu ca 60 phut
# Loi thoat: 9 tau HEAVY qua G6 ve ben 8, 20 tau MEDIUM qua G4 ve ben 28
# Cham banh dau 00:01:35.000, cuoi 00:59:32.590; nhip TB 124.2 s (nho nhat 114.4, lon nhat 140.8)
# Rang buoc chat nhat theo cap lien tiep: {'phan_cach_5NM': 5, 'moc_2NM': 23, 'cat_qua_35R': 0}
#
# PHAN CACH AP DUNG:
#   Ha canh lien tiep 35L: toi thieu giam sat ATS 5 NM va nhieu dong Doc 4444 8.7.3.4 tai luc tau truoc cham banh
#   Tau ha canh truoc thoat ly het khoi 35L (duoi tau qua vach dung cho 35L) truoc khi tau sau toi 2 NM
#   Tau ha canh truoc cat qua het 35R truoc khi tau sau vuot nguong 35L (du thao muc 3; Doc 4444 7.10)
#   Thoat ly 35L <= 100 s, cat qua 35R <= 45 s (du thao muc 3)
#
# GIA DINH:
#   Tau den dau tien tao giua duong luc 0 de khong co pha khoi dong; khong gio, khong bay lai; ASAS OFF.
#   Tau den bi xoa khi toi ben; pha lan dieu khien bang MOVE nhip 2 s.
#
# CANH BAO KHI SINH:
#   (khong co)
# =========================================================================

